<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>İyi Ki Doğdun!</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      background-color: #050508;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }
    .space-bg {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .stars {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background: radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 10% 10%, #ffffff, rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                  radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 20% 40%, #ffffff, rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                  radial-gradient(2px 2px at 35% 70%, #ffffff, rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                  radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 50% 20%, #ffffff, rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                  radial-gradient(2px 2px at 65% 85%, #ffffff, rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                  radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 80% 30%, #ffffff, rgba(0,0,0,0)),
                  radial-gradient(2px 2px at 90% 60%, #ffffff, rgba(0,0,0,0));
      background-size: 200px 200px;
      opacity: 0.8;
      animation: twinkle 4s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
    }
    @keyframes twinkle {
      0% { opacity: 0.4; }
      100% { opacity: 0.9; }
    }
    .moon {
      position: absolute;
      top: 40px;
      right: 40px;
      width: 70px;
      height: 70px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: -12px 10px 0 2px #fffde7;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(255, 253, 231, 0.6));
    }
    .shooting-star {
      position: absolute;
      top: -100px;
      width: 100px;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #fff, transparent);
      animation: shoot 6s infinite ease-in-out;
      opacity: 0;
    }
    .shooting-star:nth-child(2) {
      top: 15%;
      animation-delay: 2s;
    }
    .shooting-star:nth-child(3) {
      top: 30%;
      animation-delay: 4.5s;
    }
    @keyframes shoot {
      0% { transform: translateX(0) translateY(0) rotate(-35deg); opacity: 1; }
      20% { transform: translateX(-300px) translateY(200px) rotate(-35deg); opacity: 0; }
      100% { transform: translateX(-300px) translateY(200px) rotate(-35deg); opacity: 0; }
    }
    .container {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .page {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 500px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      transition: opacity 0.5s ease, transform 0.5s ease;
    }
    .hidden {
      display: none !important;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: scale(0.95);
    }
    .envelope-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 50px;
      width: 280px;
      height: 180px;
      background-color: #e63946;
      border-radius: 0 0 10px 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.4);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease;
    }
    .envelope-wrapper:active {
      transform: scale(0.98);
    }
    .envelope-flap {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 0;
      border-left: 140px solid transparent;
      border-right: 140px solid transparent;
      border-top: 100px solid #c1121f;
      transform-origin: top;
      transition: transform 0.4s ease;
      z-index: 3;
    }
    .envelope-wrapper.open .envelope-flap {
      transform: rotateX(180deg);
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .heart-seal {
      position: absolute;
      top: 35px;
      z-index: 4;
      font-size: 32px;
      color: #ffb703;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
      transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    }
    .envelope-wrapper.open .heart-seal {
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .letter {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 10px;
      width: 90%;
      background: #fff;
      color: #2b2d42;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      transition: transform 0.6s ease, opacity 0.6s ease;
      z-index: 2;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .envelope-wrapper.open .letter {
      transform: translateY(-130px);
      opacity: 1;
      pointer-events: auto;
      z-index: 10;
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .floating-hearts {
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 12;
    }
    .mini-heart {
      position: absolute;
      color: #ff4d6d;
      font-size: 16px;
      animation: floatUp 2s ease-out forwards;
      opacity: 1;
    }
    @keyframes floatUp {
      0% { transform: translateY(0) scale(0.8); opacity: 1; }
      100% { transform: translateY(-80px) scale(1.3); opacity: 0; }
    }
    .next-btn {
      margin-top: 25px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4d6d, #c1121f);
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(255, 77, 109, 0.4);
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .next-btn:active {
      transform: scale(0.95);
    }
    .card-box {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      width: 100%;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .date-title {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ff8fa3;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 143, 163, 0.5);
    }
    .tap-hint {
      color: #ff8fa3;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-top: 15px;
      animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.6; }
      50% { opacity: 1; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="space-bg">
    <div class="stars"></div>
    <div class="moon"></div>
    <div class="shooting-star" style="left: 80%;"></div>
    <div class="shooting-star" style="left: 50%;"></div>
    <div class="shooting-star" style="left: 30%;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <div id="page1" class="page">
      <div id="envelope" class="envelope-wrapper" onclick="openEnvelope()">
        <div class="envelope-flap"></div>
        <div class="heart-seal">❤️</div>
        <div id="heartsContainer" class="floating-hearts"></div>
      </div>

      <div id="letter" class="letter hidden">
        <h2 style="color: #c1121f; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 1.3rem;">İyi Ki Doğdun Sevdiğim ❤️</h2>
        <p>
          Hayatıma girdiğin ilk andan beri gökyüzündeki tüm yıldızlar senin için parlıyor sanki... 
          Gülüşünle dünyamı aydınlatan, varlığıyla her günümü özel kılan en değerli varlığımsın.
          <br><br>
          İyi ki doğdun, iyi ki benim oldun. Yeni yaşında yüzünden gülücükler, kalbinden huzur hiç eksik olmasın. Seni çok ama çok seviyorum! ✨
        </p>
        <button class="next-btn" onclick="goToPage2()">Sonraki Sayfa ✨</button>
      </div>

      <div id="tapHint" class="tap-hint">Zarfa dokunarak mektubu aç ❤️</div>
    </div>

    <div id="page2" class="page hidden">
      <div class="card-box">
        <div class="date-title">✨ 3.10.26 Dünyanın En Güzel Günü ✨</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    function openEnvelope() {
      const envelope = document.getElementById('envelope');
      const letter = document.getElementById('letter');
      const tapHint = document.getElementById('tapHint');
      
      if (!envelope.classList.contains('open')) {
        envelope.classList.add('open');
        tapHint.style.display = 'none';
        createHearts();
        
        setTimeout(() => {
          letter.classList.remove('hidden');
        }, 300);
      }
    }

    function createHearts() {
      const container = document.getElementById('heartsContainer');
      for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {
        setTimeout(() => {
          const heart = document.createElement('div');
          heart.className = 'mini-heart';
          heart.innerHTML = '❤️';
          heart.style.left = (Math.random() * 80 + 10) + '%';
          heart.style.bottom = (Math.random() * 20 + 40) + 'px';
          container.appendChild(heart);
          
          setTimeout(() => heart.remove(), 2000);
        }, i * 150);
      }
    }

    function goToPage2() {
      document.getElementById('page1').classList.add('hidden');
      document.getElementById('page2').classList.remove('hidden');
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
